# Model policy — Cursor Grok 4.5 only

For **all** work in this FundTrack project (implementation, docs, review, debugging, Task/subagents):

- Use **only** Cursor Grok 4.5.
- When launching the Task tool or any subagent, set:

```text
model: cursor-grok-4.5-high-fast
```

- Do **not** use Claude Sonnet, Claude Opus, Composer, GPT, Kimi, or other models for this repo.
- Do **not** omit the model parameter (no “auto”) for Task/subagents — always pass `cursor-grok-4.5-high-fast`.

If the user asks to switch models, update this rule first.
